From: Phosphor <engineering@phosphor.co>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 21:37:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(p6r): use best-effort native attribution in shared
 environments

Preserve accepted authors and editors, machine fallback, minimal sender wrappers,
identity presentation and participant contracts. Consolidate prior native fixes.
Remove identity admission expiry and issuance-only checks; retain operation lifecycle.
