+for your current connection. `bb settings p6r-identity --json` and
+`sdk.system.p6rIdentity()` expose the same check for their own request; a local CLI
+connection need not resolve to the same person as a browser behind a trusted
+proxy. An unconfigured instance retains native local behavior. An unavailable
+configured provider does not fall back to a claimed name.
